//RS //! `migration` blocks for versions `< <ver>` are no longer required. This NEVER
//RS //! edits user source — only the committed `.jet/cache/schema/*.snapshot` files.
//RS //!
//RS //! There is NO `jet inspect schema check` verb — `jet build`'s E0910 is already the CI gate.
